Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:20:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] fix(plugin-mcp): array row ids in input schemas; isError
 and receipts in create and find; default instructions

Array rows keep their optional id in the input schemas (see payloadcms/payload#19435 and #18063). Create gets
the data argument and compact receipts; find sets isError on its error answers; tool annotations; default server
instructions describing the write contract when the app sets none.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
